          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="deferred_notes" value="DECLARED FKs (enforced since 2026-08-08): quizzes.subject_id→subjects.id; answer_keys.subject_id→subjects.id, quiz_id→quizzes.id;
  scans.quiz_id→quizzes.id; scan_images.scan_id→scans.id; subject_records.subject_id→subjects.id, scan_id→scans.id; records.quiz_id→quizzes.id.

DEFERRED / Recommended future normalization (not implemented — would require destructive schema changes):
1. records.source_received_paper_id → received_papers.id: semantic link only (dashed). Not a declared FK; adding it needs a table rebuild and would break DELETE /received-papers/:id.
2. scans legacy subject columns: social_* and filipino_* are never read; math_*/english_*/science_*/general_*/abstract_* are actively written. Suggested cleanup: drop social_*/filipino_* in a future migration.
3. age type mismatch: received_papers.age INTEGER vs records.age TEXT. Unify to TEXT (QR metadata is a string).
4. users/systems are disconnected: scanned_by/created_by/reviewed_by are free-text; no user_id FKs exist. systems has no link to received_papers.device_id.
5. quizzes.subject_id (single-subject) vs subject_config JSON (multi-subject). A normalized quiz_subjects table is possible; deferred.
6. scans.photo/image_path/thumbnail_path store paths; scan_images table is legacy and never written by the app." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1686" width="1900" height="300" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
